    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18927" root="سجر" body-key="s">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انسجر</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a vessel) <i>became full.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
[<i>It</i> (hair) <i>hung down.</i> (See the part. n., voce
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْجُورٌ</span>.)] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انسجرت الإِبِلُ</span> <i>The camels followed
one another in a continuous series,</i> or <i>uninterruptedly,</i> in their march, or progress: (S, K: *
[but in some copies of the K, for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انسجر فِى السَّيْرِ</span>,
is put <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْجَرَ</span>:]) or <i>they advanced and hastened;</i>
as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انشجر</span>. (TA.)

